Martian Mono Nerd Font is Martian Mono patched with Nerd Fonts icons
and symbols. This package installs Regular, Medium, and Bold TrueType
styles, including Condensed styles.

Nerd Font, Mono, and Propo variants are included. Choose the
MartianMono Nerd Font Mono family for single-cell icons in a terminal.

The package version follows the Nerd Fonts release. No font patching
is needed. Installation and removal refresh font caches; restart any
applications that do not pick up font changes automatically.
